<li>617: Boikot &lt;a href="Hashemites"&gt;Hashemites&lt;/a&gt; sareng Nabi &lt;a href="Muhammad"&gt;Muhammad&lt;/a&gt; ku kaom Quraisy.</li>
<li>619: Dicabutna boikot. Pupusna &lt;a href="Abu%20Tholib"&gt;Abu Tholib&lt;/a&gt; sareng &lt;a href="Khodijah"&gt;Khodijah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Taun%20Kasedihan"&gt;Taun Kasedihan&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>620: Nyumpingan &lt;a href="Thoif"&gt;Thoif&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Isro%20Mi%27roj"&gt;Isro Mi'roj&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>622: &lt;a href="Hijrah%20%28Islam%29"&gt;Hijrah&lt;/a&gt; - ngalih ka Madinah. Taun munggaran dina kalénder Islam.</li>
<li>624: &lt;a href="Perang%20Badar"&gt;Perang Badar&lt;/a&gt;. Dikaluarkeunnana Yahudi &lt;a href="Bani%20Qoinuqo"&gt;Bani Qoinuqo&lt;/a&gt; ti &lt;a href="Madinah"&gt;Madinah&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>625: Lahirna &lt;a href="Hasan%20bin%20Ali"&gt;Hasan bin Ali&lt;/a&gt; nu mangrupa &lt;a href="Imam"&gt;Imam&lt;/a&gt; kadua dina &lt;a href="Siah"&gt;Siah&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Uhud"&gt;Perang Uhud&lt;/a&gt;. Dikaluarkeunnana Yahudi &lt;a href="Banu%20Nadir"&gt;Banu Nadir&lt;/a&gt; ti Madinah.</li>
<li>626: Lahirna &lt;a href="Hus%C3%A9n%20bin%20Ali"&gt;Husén bin Ali&lt;/a&gt; nu mangrupa &lt;a href="Imam"&gt;Imam&lt;/a&gt; katilu dina &lt;a href="Siah"&gt;Siah&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="%C3%89ksp%C3%A9disi"&gt;Ékspédisi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Banu%20Mustaliq"&gt;Banu Mustaliq&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>627: &lt;a href="Perang%20Khondaq"&gt;Perang Khondaq&lt;/a&gt;. Hukuman pati jeung ngajadikeun budak ka Yahudi &lt;a href="Banu%20Quraiza"&gt;Banu Quraiza&lt;/a&gt; nu ngabantu musuh Islam sarta ingkar jangji.</li>
<li>628: &lt;a href="Perjangjian%20Hudaybiyyah"&gt;Perjangjian Hudaybiyyah&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Khaybar"&gt;Perang Khaybar&lt;/a&gt;. Nabi Muhammad ngintun serat ka sababaraha kapala nagara.</li>
<li>629: Nabi Muhammad munggah haji ka &lt;a href="Mekah"&gt;Mekah&lt;/a&gt;. Ékspédisi ka &lt;a href="Mu%27ta"&gt;Mu'ta&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>630: &lt;a href="Meunangkeun%20Mekah"&gt;Meunangkeun Mekah&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Hunayn"&gt;Perang Hunayn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Auras"&gt;Perang Auras&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Ngepung%20al-Ta%27if"&gt;Ngepung al-Ta'if&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
