<li>632: Pupusna Nabi Muhammad. Pupusna &lt;a href="Fatimah"&gt;Fatimah&lt;/a&gt;, putrina. &lt;a href="Abu%20Bakar"&gt;Abu Bakar&lt;/a&gt; mangku tugas salaku &lt;a href="khalifah"&gt;khalifah&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Zu%20Qissa"&gt;Perang Zu Qissa&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Zu%20Abraq"&gt;Perang Zu Abraq&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Buzakha"&gt;Perang Buzakha&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Zafar"&gt;Perang Zafar&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Naqra"&gt;Perang Naqra&lt;/a&gt;. Merangan &lt;a href="Bani%20Tamim"&gt;Bani Tamim&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Musailimah"&gt;Musailimah&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>633: Perang di &lt;a href="Bahrain"&gt;Bahrain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Oman"&gt;Oman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yaman"&gt;Yaman&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Hadramaut"&gt;Hadramaut&lt;/a&gt;. Nyerang &lt;a href="Irak"&gt;Irak&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;a href="Perang%20Kazima"&gt;Perang Kazima&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Mazar"&gt;Perang Mazar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Walaja"&gt;Perang Walaja&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Ulleis"&gt;Perang Ulleis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Hirah"&gt;Perang Hirah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Anbar"&gt;Perang Anbar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Ein"&gt;Perang Ein&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Daumatul%20Jandal"&gt;Perang Daumatul Jandal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Firaz"&gt;Perang Firaz&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>634: &lt;a href="Perang%20Basrah"&gt;Perang Basrah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Damaskus"&gt;Perang Damaskus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Ajnadin"&gt;Perang Ajnadin&lt;/a&gt;. Pupusna Abu Bakr. &lt;a href="Umar%20bin%20al-Khattab"&gt;Umar bin al-Khattab&lt;/a&gt; janten khalifah. &lt;a href="Perang%20Namaraq"&gt;Perang Namaraq&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Saqatia"&gt;Perang Saqatia&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>635: &lt;a href="Perang%20Sasak"&gt;Perang Sasak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Buwaib"&gt;Perang Buwaib&lt;/a&gt;, Nalukkeun &lt;a href="Damaskus"&gt;Damaskus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Fahl"&gt;Perang Fahl&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>636: &lt;a href="Perang%20Yarmuk"&gt;Perang Yarmuk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Qadsiyia"&gt;Perang Qadsiyia&lt;/a&gt;, Nalukkeun &lt;a href="Madain"&gt;Madain&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>637: Nalukkeun &lt;a href="Syria"&gt;Syria&lt;/a&gt;, nalukkeun &lt;a href="Y%C3%A9rusalem"&gt;Yérusalem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Jalula"&gt;Perang Jalula&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
