<li>677: Nalukkeun &lt;a href="Samarkand"&gt;Samarkand&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Tirmiz"&gt;Tirmiz&lt;/a&gt;. Ngepung &lt;a href="Konstantinopel"&gt;Konstantinopel&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>680: Pupusna Muawiyah. &lt;a href="Yazid%20I"&gt;Yazid I&lt;/a&gt; janten &lt;a href="khalifah"&gt;khalifah&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Perang%20Karbala"&gt;Perang Karbala&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hus%C3%A9n%20bin%20Ali"&gt;Husén bin Ali&lt;/a&gt; tiwas. &lt;a href="Ali%20bin%20Hus%C3%A9n"&gt;Ali bin Husén&lt;/a&gt; janten &lt;a href="Imam"&gt;Imam&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
